<!--
  Content of the decoy shown after the emergency PIN.

  The conversations are deliberately dull: errands, shifts, a parcel, a broken
  washing machine. A decoy full of interesting content invites the very
  question it exists to avoid. Nothing here names NovaGram, security, privacy
  or anything a reader could recognise as staged.

  Message items are "speaker|text". Speaker 0 is the account owner, 1 and above
  are the other participants of that conversation in order.
-->
